FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.24@sha256:d2d2bc1c84f7e60d7d2438a3836ae7d0c847f4888464e7ec9ba3a1339a1ee804 AS build
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH

WORKDIR /workspace

COPY code-audit-server/go.mod code-audit-server/go.sum ./code-audit-server/
COPY contracts/go/go.mod contracts/go/go.sum ./contracts/go/
COPY shared/sourceidentity/go.mod ./shared/sourceidentity/
RUN --mount=type=cache,id=axiom-public-go-modules,target=/go/pkg/mod cd code-audit-server && go mod download

COPY code-audit-server /workspace/code-audit-server
COPY contracts/go /workspace/contracts/go
COPY shared/sourceidentity /workspace/shared/sourceidentity

RUN --mount=type=cache,id=axiom-public-go-modules,target=/go/pkg/mod cd code-audit-server && CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH:-amd64} go build -trimpath -o /out/axiom-server ./cmd/server
RUN --mount=type=cache,id=axiom-public-go-modules,target=/go/pkg/mod cd code-audit-server && CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH:-amd64} go build -trimpath -o /out/axiom-migrate ./cmd/migrate

FROM debian:12-slim@sha256:7c7b2c966bc9ee8cedfeef67e0e279108992c77681fa595db4a9d65c06ccc587
ARG AXIOM_BUILD_VERSION=development
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.version=$AXIOM_BUILD_VERSION \
      org.opencontainers.image.source="https://github.com/m0b1u3/Axiom" \
      org.opencontainers.image.licenses="Apache-2.0"
COPY LICENSE NOTICE /usr/share/doc/axiom/
RUN apt-get update \
    && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends ca-certificates tzdata \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

RUN useradd -m -u 1001 axiom
WORKDIR /opt/axiom
COPY --from=build /out/axiom-server /opt/axiom/bin/axiom-server
COPY --from=build /out/axiom-migrate /opt/axiom/bin/axiom-migrate
RUN chmod +x /opt/axiom/bin/axiom-server && mkdir -p /app/data \
    && chown axiom:axiom /app/data && chmod 700 /app/data

USER axiom
CMD ["/opt/axiom/bin/axiom-server"]
